{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04910","headline":"奉和晦日幸昆明池应制 · 李乂","name":"奉和晦日幸昆明池应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉辂寻春赏，金堤重晦游。\n川通黑水浸，地派紫泉流。\n晃朗扶桑出，绵联杞树周。\n乌疑填海处，人似隔河秋。\n劫尽灰犹识，年移石故留。\n汀洲归棹晚，箫鼓杂汾讴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}